msgstr "本服务依赖的网关契约"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:4
msgid ""
"The three YAML documents describe the Gateway HTTP APIs consumed by Cloud"
" Agent. They record the cross-repository boundary: Cloud Agent uses HTTP,"
" never imports Gateway modules, and never holds the Gateway's signing "
"secrets."
msgstr ""
"这三份 YAML 文档描述了 Cloud Agent 调用的网关 HTTP API，也划清了两个仓库之间的边界：Cloud Agent 只通过 "
"HTTP 和网关打交道，从不导入网关的模块，也从不持有网关的签名密钥。"

