#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:17
msgid "What these are, and what they are not"
msgstr "这些文档是什么，不是什么"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:19
msgid ""
"The YAML contracts are hand-written from Gateway source. They document "
"the agreed interface independently of a running deployment. Only "
"endpoints consumed by this service are included; they are not a complete "
"Gateway API reference."
msgstr ""
"YAML 契约是对照网关源代码手写的，记录的是双方约定的接口，不依赖任何一套正在运行的部署。里面只收录本服务用到的端点，并不是完整的网关 API "
"参考。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:23
msgid ""
"The application does not load these documents or validate every response "
"against OpenAPI at runtime. Consumer tests and review check agreement "
"with the contracts. Runtime clients handle compatible additions such as "
"optional fields; the live contract tests can still flag undeclared "
"additions for documentation review."
msgstr ""
"应用运行时不会加载这些文档，也不会拿 OpenAPI "
"去校验每个响应。契约是否一致，靠调用方的测试和代码评审来把关。运行时的客户端能兼容新增的可选字段之类的变化；线上契约测试仍会把文档里没声明的新增内容标出来，提醒更新文档。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:28
msgid "Source commits"
msgstr "来源 commit"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:30
msgid ""
"Each document's `info.x-source` records the repository, branch, source "
"files, and, when available, commit used to write it. These references are"
" provenance, not a statement that your Gateway deployment runs that "
"version."
msgstr ""
"每份文档的 `info.x-source` 记录了编写时依据的仓库、分支、源文件，以及能确定时的 "
"commit。这些只是出处，不代表你的网关部署跑的就是那个版本。"

