#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:43
msgid ""
"That historical check does not establish readiness of a current "
"deployment. When a Gateway router changes, compare the contract with its "
"merged source and run the relevant consumer and live contract tests. The "
"local suite cannot read or verify files in the Gateway repository."
msgstr "这次检查只是历史记录，不能说明当前的部署已经就绪。网关路由有变化时，要把契约和合并后的源代码对一遍，并跑相关的调用方测试和线上契约测试。本地测试读不到网关仓库里的文件，也就没法替你验证。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Agent admission is described in `internal-lookups.openapi.yaml`; it is "
"not a fourth contract. The client uses `/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-"
"access` rather than the user-status lookup. Profile uses the existing "
"user-status endpoint only to display the owner's current email; its role "
"and status fields never authorize Agent access. Before connecting an "
"older Gateway, read [agent access policy](../docs/developer/agent-access-"
"policy.md) for deployment policy, rollout requirements, and fail-closed "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Agent 的准入也写在 `internal-lookups.openapi.yaml` 里，不是第四份契约。客户端调用的是 "
"`/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access`，而不是用户状态查询接口。Profile "
"用现有的用户状态端点，仅仅是为了显示所有者当前的邮箱；其中的角色和状态字段从不用于授权 Agent 访问。接入旧版网关之前，请先读 [Agent "
"准入策略](../docs/developer/agent-access-"
"policy.md)，了解部署策略、上线要求，以及出错时一律拒绝访问的行为。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:56
msgid "What these do not cover"
msgstr "这些文档没有覆盖的内容"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:58
msgid ""
"Response schemas alone do not establish grant timing or the meaning of a "
"refusal. Keep these dependencies aligned with the Gateway:"
msgstr "光看响应的 schema，看不出授权的时间规则，也看不出一次拒绝具体意味着什么。下面这些依赖需要和网关保持一致："

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:61
msgid ""
"`GATEWAY_MAX_TTL_S = 900` and `GATEWAY_RENEWAL_STEP_S = 300` in "
"`grants.py` mirror the Gateway's maximum and default grant TTL. The "
"contract records them as `MAX_GRANT_TTL_S` and `DEFAULT_GRANT_TTL_S` "
"under `x-constants`. Requests above the maximum are clamped, and renewal "
"resets expiry using the renewal step, so a mismatch can shorten a live "
"grant without a failed call."
msgstr ""
"`grants.py` 里的 `GATEWAY_MAX_TTL_S = 900` 和 `GATEWAY_RENEWAL_STEP_S = "
"300`，对应网关授权的最长 TTL 和默认 TTL，契约在 `x-constants` 下把它们记为 `MAX_GRANT_TTL_S` 和 "
"`DEFAULT_GRANT_TTL_S`。请求的 TTL "
"超过最大值会被截断，续期时按续期步长重新计算过期时间；所以两边的值一旦对不上，可能没有任何调用报错，有效授权的寿命却悄悄变短了。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:66
msgid ""
"`DEAD_GRANT_REFUSALS` in `cloud_agent/workers/attempts.py` contains "
"`unknown_grant`, `grant_not_live`, and `subject_unavailable`. The worker "
"uses the error type to distinguish a dead grant from a Gateway "
"configuration or authentication failure. HTTP status alone is "
"insufficient: a 404 can mean either a dead grant or an unconfigured "
"internal API."
msgstr ""
"`cloud_agent/workers/attempts.py` 里的 `DEAD_GRANT_REFUSALS` 包含 "
"`unknown_grant`、`grant_not_live` 和 `subject_unavailable`。worker "
"靠错误类型来区分\"授权已失效\"和\"网关配置或认证出了问题\"。只看 HTTP 状态码是不够的：同样是 404，可能是授权失效了，也可能是内部"
" API 根本没配置。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:72
msgid ""
"`test_grant_constants_match_contract.py` compares the client constants "
"with the YAML document. `test_grant_lifecycle.py` checks them against the"
" client's renewal cadence and pins the dead-grant error types. The opt-in"
" live grant lifecycle test checks the deployed Gateway's timing; local "
"tests cannot establish that it uses these values."
msgstr ""
"`test_grant_constants_match_contract.py` 会拿客户端的常量和 YAML "
"文档对比。`test_grant_lifecycle.py` "
"会结合客户端的续期节奏检查这些常量，并锁定授权失效时的错误类型。可选的线上授权生命周期测试会检查已部署网关的实际时间规则；本地测试没法确认网关真的用的是这些值。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:78
msgid "The one document here that is ours"
msgstr "这里唯一属于我们自己的文档"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:80
msgid ""
"[agent-control-plane.openapi.json](agent-control-plane.openapi.json) "
"records the API served by Cloud Agent. It is generated from "
"`create_app().openapi()` and committed with sorted keys so API changes "
"can be reviewed."
msgstr ""
"[agent-control-plane.openapi.json](agent-control-plane.openapi.json) 记录 "
"Cloud Agent 对外提供的 API。它由 `create_app().openapi()` 生成，按键排序后提交，方便评审 API "
"的改动。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:84
msgid ""
"`tests/unit/test_api_surface_contract.py` compares the served schema with"
" this snapshot and fails on disagreement. It does not regenerate the "
"file. For an intentional API change, use the command in the [developer "
"guide](../docs/developer/development.md#changing-an-api), review the "
"diff, and commit it with the implementation change."
msgstr ""
"`tests/unit/test_api_surface_contract.py` 会拿实际提供的 schema "
"和这份快照对比，不一致就失败；它只检查，不会重新生成文件。有意改 API "
"时，用[开发者指南](../docs/developer/development.md#changing-an-api)里的命令重新生成，看一遍 "
"diff，和实现代码一起提交。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:90
msgid "Checking them"
msgstr "怎样检查"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:92
msgid "From the repository root, run the local document and snapshot checks:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录跑本地的文档检查和快照检查："

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:101
msgid ""
"The contract checks validate YAML documents as OpenAPI, verify that their"
" `x-pinned-by.consumer` test paths exist, and check that `/internal/` and"
" `/v1/` path literals in `gateway.py` and `grants.py` appear in a "
"document. CI runs these checks. They establish agreement within this "
"repository, not agreement with a live Gateway."
msgstr ""
"契约检查会把 YAML 文档当作 OpenAPI 校验，确认 `x-pinned-by.consumer` 指向的测试文件确实存在，并检查 "
"`gateway.py` 和 `grants.py` 里出现的每个 `/internal/` 和 `/v1/` 路径都写进了某份文档。CI "
"会跑这些检查。不过它们只能保证本仓库内部前后一致，保证不了和线上网关一致。"

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:107
msgid ""
"To check a deployment, set `AGENT_CONTRACT_GATEWAY_URL` and "
"`AGENT_CONTRACT_DISPATCH_TOKEN`, then run:"
msgstr ""
"要检查一套部署，先设置 `AGENT_CONTRACT_GATEWAY_URL` 和 "
"`AGENT_CONTRACT_DISPATCH_TOKEN`，然后运行："

#: ../../gateway_contracts/README.md:116
msgid ""
"These probes check JWKS keys and typed refusals using randomly named "
"missing accounts. The grant lifecycle case skips unless "
"`AGENT_CONTRACT_SUBJECT` names an account selected for the test. Setting "
"that variable opts into minting, renewing, and revoking a real grant; the"
" test revokes it during cleanup. See [smoke "
"testing](../docs/developer/smoke.md) for the wider deployment checks."
msgstr ""
"这些探测会用随机命名、实际不存在的账号，检查 JWKS 密钥和带类型的拒绝响应。授权生命周期这个用例默认跳过，除非用 "
"`AGENT_CONTRACT_SUBJECT` "
"指定一个专门用于测试的账号。设置了这个变量，就表示你同意测试真的签发、续期和撤销一个授权；测试结束清理时会把它撤销。更全面的部署检查见[冒烟测试](../docs/developer/smoke.md)。"

